Innovative products have also played a significant role in boosting sales, particularly Imboost Extra, which is enriched with Vitamin C and D3, available in both tablet and effervescent formats.

E-commerce has become one of our key growth drivers in 2024, as it expands consumers' options to easily find our products online. E-commerce is also leveraged to drive stronger conversion rates from digital marketing activities.

