To measure principals' perception of PPG's service and reputation, the Company also conducts routine customer satisfaction surveys through an independent third-party surveyor, PT Inmar Infos Sarana. Factors measured include the salesman's skill and knowledge, delivery, ease of ordering from the application, and responsiveness.

Untuk mengukur persepsi prinsipal terhadap layanan dan reputasi PPG, Perusahaan juga melakukan survei kepuasan pelanggan rutin melalui surveyor independen pihak ketiga, PT Inmar Infos Sarana. Faktor-faktor yang diukur meliputi keterampilan dan pengetahuan salesman, pengiriman, kemudahan memesan dari aplikasi, dan responsivitas.

